      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR CHICK (5) was resuming when finishing fifth at this track in a NG (30.21). Sure to be fitter and the extra ground is a plus. Should be very hard to beat this time. BOBBIN' BRUNO (4) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from five starts. Was out of placings last time (29.79) at this track in a NG, finishing fourth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. NANGAR ZARA (7) was in the minors when resuming at this track where she finished third (29.73) in a NG. Extra ground should suit and will strip fitter for the run. Will give a great sight again. ZIPPING MOONEY (1) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
